<shape type="text" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="22" width="700" height="34"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="22" color="rgb(36,49,65)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>四、可借鉴的三点 + CP-CLIP 留下的缺口</p></content></shape><img src="BqYhbbUzWo3uNyx5YDxcIg8Xnfd" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="120" width="400" height="290"/><shape type="text" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="420" width="400" height="80"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(139,148,158)" lineSpacing="1.4"><p>（左侧为四类问题图，可替换为你自己截取的 CP-CLIP 结构图放大版）</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="96" width="34" height="34" cornerRadius="17"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(61,111,168)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="102" width="34" height="24"><content textType="body" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="15" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>1</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="94" width="400" height="28"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" color="rgb(61,111,168)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>借它的解构思路</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="122" width="400" height="56"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.4"><p>先拆开、再对齐。类别描述里的核心词与位置修饰词混编，会互相稀释。</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="186" width="34" height="34" cornerRadius="17"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,125,91)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="192" width="34" height="24"><content textType="body" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="15" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>2</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="184" width="400" height="28"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" color="rgb(46,125,91)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>借它的加权思想</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="212" width="400" height="56"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.4"><p>核心语义词权重高、外围修饰词权重低，改动小、好实现、好验证。</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="276" width="34" height="34" cornerRadius="17"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(200,125,20)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="282" width="34" height="24"><content textType="body" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="15" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>3</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="274" width="400" height="28"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" color="rgb(200,125,20)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>补它的缺口</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="516" topLeftY="302" width="400" height="56"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.4"><p>它没做「核心与外围的关系建模」，正是 M3GCD 类别扩散能接上的一环。</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="372" width="446" height="116" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(253,248,239)"/></fill><border color="rgb(200,125,20)" width="1.6"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="490" topLeftY="386" width="410" height="30"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(200,125,20)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>一句话定位</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="490" topLeftY="414" width="410" height="70"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.45"><p>把结构化处理从「图像空间的主次分离」迁移到「语义空间的类别关联」，这是有据可依的迁移，不是生造创新。</p></content></shape>
</data>
